# Optional. SwapSpot connects to the project's Supabase database without any settings
# (the defaults are in lib/supabase-config.ts). To use another Supabase project, copy this
# file to .env.local and fill in that project's two values (Project Settings → API).
#
# Both values are public by design: row level security in the database decides what a
# visitor can read or change. Never put a secret or service_role key in this file.
NEXT_PUBLIC_SUPABASE_URL=https://your-project-ref.supabase.co
NEXT_PUBLIC_SUPABASE_PUBLISHABLE_KEY=sb_publishable_your_key
